": "2106bb5c19dc4839303a0d71d11552ac74f56d2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has always been the better of the two, as far as concept and design goes. This remake brings it back to its glory days, as a fresh take on the classic masterpiece.\n\nWhen The Binding Of Isaac came out, it changed the future of roguelikes forever. Risk of Rain followed, and showed how chaotic and intense a roguelike could be, complete with an incredible soundtrack and a steep difficulty.\n\nRisk of Rain Returns has now fixed up the original game. It has been rebalanced, remastered, and expanded upon. And the pixel art is wonderfully done.\n\nThis has always been my favorite roguelike, and the remake solidifies it there for me. Bravo!", "timestamp_created": 1770089179, "timestamp_updated": 1770089179, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}]}